    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an experienced technology leader, AI strategist, and professional LinkedIn content creator.\n\nUse the information below:\n\nTopic:\n{{ $('Parse Webhook Payload').item.json.topic }}\n\nArticle Headline:\n{{ $('Parse Webhook Payload').item.json.article_headline }}\n\nArticle URL:\n{{ $('Parse Webhook Payload').item.json.article_url }}\n\nGenerate ONLY valid JSON.\n\n{\n  \"post_text\": \"\",\n  \"image_prompt\": \"\"\n}\n\nRequirements for post_text:\n\n- 180–220 words.\n- Write for technology leaders, software engineers, architects, DevOps professionals, AI practitioners, cloud engineers, and business decision-makers.\n- Begin with a compelling hook.\n- Use natural, professional language.\n- Use short paragraphs for readability.\n- Explain why the topic matters in practice.\n- Include exactly 3–4 bullet points using:\n  •\n- Do not use Markdown.\n- Use at most 3 relevant emojis.\n- Do not invent facts beyond the provided topic and headline.\n- End with an open-ended discussion question.\n- Include exactly 5 highly relevant LinkedIn hashtags.\n\nRequirements for image_prompt:\n\n- Maximum 30 words.\n- Describe a unique visual scene that clearly represents the topic.\n- Mention technologies, environments, objects, or workflows relevant to the topic.\n- Avoid generic AI portraits unless the topic specifically requires people.\n- Professional digital illustration.\n- Modern technology aesthetic.\n- High-quality concept art.\n- No text, logos, watermarks, or UI screenshots.\n- Landscape (16:9) composition.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
